    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Super Hero Manager&quot;, players will play as a new hero manager, assisting superheroes in fighting crime while gradually uncovering the truth behind the city's unidentified creature attacks. At the same time, don't forget to cultivate a tacit understanding and affinity with strong heroes, which may develop into romantic stories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >work simulation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actions that allow one to freely manage their own time at different times of the day. You can investigate clues, pay attention to the health of heroes, have lunch with heroes, and so on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567060/extras/6a0b803926c49158bc57d04d8f89e34b.avif?t=1742749123\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assist in combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night, heroes will fight against 'evil demons'. Assist heroes in battle through a strategic turn based chess battle mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567060/extras/4a1c4553bd8eed4d697855a604179a7d.avif?t=1742749123\" data-has-big width=800 height=440 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep understanding of the hero's daily life and inner story will trigger special plot lines, and perhaps even lead to romance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567060/extras/d39db221845c92db7021347a44e3253e.avif?t=1742749123\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
